haracteristics","bboxPt":[452.20401,500.81326,498.48798,507.81326],"colour":"#808080","font":"Helvetica","fontSizePt":7.0,"direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"More","bboxPt":[467.37311,340.18326,483.31909,347.18326],"colour":"#808080","font":"Helvetica","fontSizePt":7.0,"direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Demand","bboxPt":[462.1196,347.18326,488.57257,354.18326],"colour":"#808080","font":"Helvetica","fontSizePt":7.0,"direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Avoidant","bboxPt":[461.72781,354.18326,488.96481,361.18326],"colour":"#808080","font":"Helvetica","fontSizePt":7.0,"direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Characteristics","bboxPt":[452.20398,361.18326,498.48795,368.18326],"colour":"#808080","font":"Helvetica","fontSizePt":7.0,"direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Interpretation","bboxPt":[34.3465,556.51855,124.57652,570.51855],"colour":"#000000","font":"Helvetica-Bold","fontSizePt":14.0,"direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The Extreme Demand Avoidance – 8 (EDA-8) questionnaire was administered on 03 December","bboxPt":[91.0394,575.77405,556.2735,586.77405],"colour":"#000000","font":"Helvetica","fontSizePt":11.0,"direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"backgroundBands":[],"series":[],"detection":{"method":"independent_axis_pair","reviewStatus":"machine_observed_not_visually_verified"},"sampleVisitCount":1,"variantEvidence":"repeat_administration","drawingEvidence":{"axisDrawingIds":[63,65],"marks":[{"drawingIndex":61,"bboxPt":[275.34601,362.40298,338.34601,528.21301],"colour":"#4e79a7","fill":"#4e79a7","stroke":"#000000","lineWidthPt":1.0}],"curves":[]}}]},{"pageId":"dccec36f2b59d_p2","documentSha256":"ccec36f2b59d1a51e8f3205847ca59ee1f3cc87065b3a539cc15629ccd84d480","pageNumber":2,"text":[{"text":"Client Name","bbox":[66.3844,116.31287,135.73239,128.31287],"origin":[66.3844,125.58502],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client (Parent)","bbox":[147.73239,116.56485,260.20737,127.56485],"origin":[147.73239,125.06433],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"averaging 2.79 (SD not reported, Median = 1) (Connolly et al., 2023).","bbox":[91.0395,143.16556,426.39645,154.16556],"origin":[91.0395,151.66504],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"It is important to note that no clinical cutoff scores have been validated for the EDA-8. Therefore,","bbox":[91.0395,167.36557,559.9917,178.36557],"origin":[91.0395,175.86505],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"it is recommended that EDA-8 scores be interpreted dimensionally rather than categorically. The","bbox":[91.0395,179.46555,559.33154,190.46555],"origin":[91.0395,187.96503],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"scoring guidance notes that scores over 19 suggest the need for more comprehensive","bbox":[91.0395,191.56552,509.85349,202.56552],"origin":[91.0395,200.065],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"assessment of extreme demand avoidance, but this should not be used as a validated threshold","bbox":[91.0395,203.6655,557.56067,214.6655],"origin":[91.0395,212.16498],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"for identifying a PDA profile.","bbox":[91.0395,215.76547,227.37347,226.76547],"origin":[91.0395,224.26495],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Clinicians should be aware that higher scores indicate a profile of demand avoidance that may","bbox":[91.0395,239.96548,548.96954,250.96548],"origin":[91.0395,248.46497],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"require tailored support approaches. Some strategies that work well for many autistic individuals","bbox":[91.0395,252.06546,557.49469,263.06546],"origin":[91.0395,260.56494],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"(such as clear routines, structured schedules, and explicit expectations) may be","bbox":[91.0395,264.16544,478.03046,275.16544],"origin":[91.0395,272.66492],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"counterproductive for those with greater levels of demand avoidance characteristics, as these","bbox":[91.0395,276.26541,545.29547,287.26541],"origin":[91.0395,284.76489],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"can paradoxically increase anxiety and avoidant responses. Although the evidence base for","bbox":[91.0395,288.36539,536.15454,299.36539],"origin":[91.0395,296.86487],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"specific strategies is still emerging, a low-demand, collaborative approach that prioritises","bbox":[91.0395,300.46536,520.79846,311.46536],"origin":[91.0395,308.96484],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"autonomy, flexibility, and anxiety reduction is often recommended (O’Nions et al., 2020).","bbox":[91.0395,312.56534,519.61053,323.56534],"origin":[91.0395,321.06482],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Responses","bbox":[34.3465,358.42853,151.8205,372.42853],"origin":[34.3465,369.24603],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Not true","bbox":[280.04037,386.57126,310.27493,395.07126],"origin":[280.04037,393.13904],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Somewhat true","bbox":[340.98578,386.57126,398.14838,395.07126],"origin":[340.98578,393.13904],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Mostly true","bbox":[423.19406,386.57126,464.75912,395.07126],"origin":[423.19406,393.13904],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Very true","bbox":[501.14413,386.57126,535.6286,395.07126],"origin":[501.14413,393